  "description": "Room-style app-document facade for .NET MAUI. One collection API; the host picks SQLite, NuvexaDB, Realm, LiteDB, DuckDB, SQLCipher, Firebird, LMDB, RocksDB, or LevelDB. Auto-migrate between engines. Source-generated DAOs and raw SQL/NQL on ILocalStore. Not a job queue or OfflineSync.",
